msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ryuuji「Is this......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Esto es......?」"

msgid "Ami「This is the recently built Luxure＿Amusement Park. I've like, ALWAYS＿wanted to come here with you①」"
msgstr "Ami「Es el recién construido Parque de＿Atracciones Luxure. O sea, SIEMPRE＿quise venir aquí contigo①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「With me?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Conmigo?」"

msgid "Ami「Of course. Takasu-kun is my V-E-R-Y＿special someone, after all.」"
msgstr "Ami「Claro. Takasu-kun es alguien M-U-Y＿especial para mí, después de todo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......When you put it so bluntly, I'm not＿sure how to react.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Cuando lo dices tan directamente,＿no sé cómo reaccionar.」"

msgid "Ami「How heartless～ You never used to＿hide your feelings before. You'd say＿\"You're my special girl, Kawashima.\"」"
msgstr "Ami「Qué cruel～ Antes nunca ocultabas tus＿sentimientos. Me decías \"Eres mi chica＿especial, Kawashima\".」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh really...... Sorry, I don't really＿remember.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ah, sí......? Perdón, la＿verdad no lo recuerdo.」"

msgid "Ami「Ufufu. You're cute when you're shy, so＿I'll forgive you①」"
msgstr "Ami「Jujuju. Te ves lindo cuando te pones＿tímido, así que te perdono①」"

msgid "Ami「That aside, this is our first date＿together, so let's have a lot of fun♪」"
msgstr "Ami「En fin, es nuestra primera cita juntos,＿así que divirtámonos mucho♪」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Y-Yeah......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「S-Sí......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「(Maybe Kawashima is doing this to＿cheer me up...... In that case, I gotta＿enjoy it to the fullest......)」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「(Tal vez Kawashima hace esto＿para animarme......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh yeah, it was quite good.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「En ese caso, tengo que disfrutarlo＿al máximo......) Ah, sí, estuvo＿bastante bien.」"

msgid "Ami「Fufu, L-I-A-R ① You didn't really pay＿attention. You kept looking around＿restlessly. I noticed, you know～」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju, M-E-N-T-I-R-O-S-O ① En realidad no＿prestaste atención. Mirabas a todos＿lados inquieto. Me di cuenta, ¿sabes～?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Sorry. I just felt strangely uneasy.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Perdón. Me sentía raro, inquieto.」"

msgid "Ami「Maybe it was because we were, like, so＿close together?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Tal vez fue porque estábamos,＿o sea, tan juntitos?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ami「I was nervous too, you know. When I＿realized how close you were, I got＿SUPER embarrassed......」"
msgstr "Ami「Yo también estaba nerviosa, ¿sabes?＿Al ver lo cerca que estabas, me sentí＿SÚPER avergonzada......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kawashima......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kawashima......」"

msgid "Ami「Hey, Takasu-kun...... Why don't we find a＿place where we can be alone? I know＿this, like, really special spot.」"
msgstr "Ami「Oye, Takasu-kun...... ¿Por qué no＿buscamos un lugar para estar a solas?＿Conozco un sitio, o sea, muy especial.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......The ferris wheel, huh? No one could＿bother us here, that's for sure.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......La rueda de la fortuna, ¿eh? Aquí＿nadie podrá molestarnos, eso seguro.」"

msgid "Ami「Yup. Were you perhaps expecting＿somewhere more private, Takasu-kun?」"
msgstr "Ami「Sip. ¿Acaso esperabas algún lugar＿más privado, Takasu-kun?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Of course I wasn't!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡P-Por supuesto que no!」"

msgid "Ami「Ufu. You stuttered. How cute～①」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju. Tartamudeaste. Qué lindo～①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Don't tease me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No te burles de mí.」"

msgid "Ami「Sowwy～! I'm like, sooo happy I get to＿be alone with you, Takasu-kun...... Ehe①」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Perdóóón～! Estoy, o sea,＿taaan feliz a solas contigo,＿Takasu-kun...... Jeje①」"

msgid "Ami「Oh, I know! Can I call you \"Ryuuji\" from＿now on? Like Aisaka-san does?」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Ah, ya sé! ¿Te puedo llamar \"Ryuuji\"＿desde ahora, como hace Aisaka-san?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Are you serious?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Hablas en serio?」"

msgid "Ami「Is that, like, a no?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Eso es, o sea, un no?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「N-No...... I don't really mind, but...... it's＿kinda awkward!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「N-No...... En realidad no me importa,＿pero...... ¡es un poco incómodo!」"

msgid "Ami「Fufu, thank you ① Oh, but leaving it,＿like, one-sided wouldn't be right, so call＿me \"Ami-chan,\" okay, Ryuuji?」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju, gracias ① Ah, pero dejarlo, o sea,＿de un solo lado no estaría bien, así que＿llámame \"Ami-chan\", ¿sí, Ryuuji?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why do I have to add \"-chan\" to it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué tengo que agregarle el \"-chan\"?」"

msgid "Ami「'Cause that's what I like to be calleddd!＿Come on, just try saying it. Say＿Ami-chan.」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Porque así me gusta que me llameeen!＿Vamos, intenta decirlo. Di Ami-chan.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「A-Ami-chan.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Ami-chan.」"

msgid "Ami「What is it, Ryuuji? ①」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Qué pasa, Ryuuji? ①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「(......M-Mortifying!)」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「(......¡Q-Qué vergüenza!)」"

msgid "Ami「Oh my, it's kinda, like, embarrassing～＿Come on Ryuuji, don't just, like, sit＿there, let's talk about something～」"
msgstr "Ami「Vaya, da como, o sea, un poco de＿vergüenza～ Vamos, Ryuuji, no te quedes＿ahí callado, hablemos de algo～」"

msgid "Ami「The rumors about the awesome＿planetarium were SOOO right～ It was＿like, SO touching and romantic ①」"
msgstr "Ami「Los rumores sobre el increíble＿planetario eran TAAAN ciertos～ Fue,＿o sea, TAN conmovedor y romántico ①」"

msgid "Ami「What did you think, Takasu-kun?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Qué te pareció, Takasu-kun?」"
